{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e6711f4a3a6e39087268fe702b8a1d356258da474d98bc0860188a3a593bd9ab", "ja": "（今度撮影する伊織のPVの打合せと、\n衣装合わせがようやく終わった）", "zh": "（伊织的PV拍摄在即，\n事前讨论及服装试穿终于告一段落了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "672bf800d34ca22db912d666aec9d72c26b55bc3978594f3b5238bc0423e9e5e", "ja": "みなさん、今日はお疲れさまでした～。\n本番も、よろしくお願いしま～す♪", "zh": "各位，今天辛苦了～\n正式拍摄时还要再麻烦你们了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "9a5d69ec5e291bca370104099c7b3b925d8d544d0cdd9b767db7098b3aad31aa", "ja": "にひひっ♪　このPVが完成すれば、\nこの伊織ちゃんの魅力が世界中に知れ渡りそうねっ。", "zh": "咿嘻嘻♪看来这支PV完成了以后，\n就能让全世界都体会到我伊织的魅力了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "849c77720e41ae5fd17d7a300af9674b69c121d1be39133b89a3320b80a6393f", "ja": "はぁ、今から発売が待ち遠しいわ～。今のファンの\nみんなも、きっと心の底から喜んでくれると思うし♪", "zh": "唉，现在就好等不及发售喔～\n粉丝们看了这支PV，一定也会欢天喜地♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "50eb98ff53221611a071b2c459a5c9581907831b033b56f063a62dfc855902f6", "ja": "そうだな。ここまでバラの花が似合うとは……。\nさすが伊織だ。俺も完成が楽しみだよ。", "zh": "是啊，居然可以这么适合玫瑰花……\n真不愧是伊织。我也很期待PV完成喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "180936ce37bbcb3329051c1f19574aff29fcb6e6f7a30f0a565311a5013acc85", "ja": "そ、そう？　そんなに私……って、当たり前じゃない！\nアンタも浮かれてないで、真面目にやりなさいよねっ。", "zh": "是、是吗？我有这么……不，这不是理所当然的吗！\n你也不要太兴奋了，要认真做事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "03b9962976b86ab711e0a325cbd1fe69938321f6df402c8466afab6831e5d909", "ja": "せっかく、いいPVに仕上がりそうなんだから。\n今まで以上に、しっかり働きなさいよね！", "zh": "难得有机会完成一支好PV，\n你要比至今为止还更努力工作喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bc7f0c1d0c691055feb18fcbd551d8e24970379afd9fd2e78c844d799309aa85", "ja": "もちろん。伊織もわからないことがあったら、\n今のうちになんでも聞いてくれ。", "zh": "那当然。如果伊织你有什么地方不清楚，\n就趁现在尽管问吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "7928f79669bf4911c84bca85856b3bac96c53f9efbff14a535a805e897c7d29c", "ja": "そうね……。あ、そういえば、\nコンテを見た時から気になってたことがあるの。", "zh": "我想想……啊，这么说来，\n我在看分镜的时候就很在意一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "3cf6522b6a69345a18e161e7771aed16f1ee9f06a5d77d2d0448ed50df5522a1", "ja": "私のこと、かなりアップで映す予定よね？\nカメラって、どれくらい近くまでくるのかしら。", "zh": "预定是要拍我的大特写对吧？\n那摄影机会靠得多近呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "716d76aff9d216a25c38beca52826780871a4b0632f8e14ecfc0660b82f2ff06", "ja": "カメラと伊織の距離か？　そうだな……。", "zh": "摄影机跟伊织的距离吗？我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_1011", "source_sha256": "de2e57679863444bfdfd29a4b3b5187885655ff99e785c3462be94e86207e603", "ja": "これくらい", "zh": "大概这么近", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4736f0b44011468cfcba5620c07c4f07522711437ece921184143de628b560d4", "ja": "こんなもんじゃないか？", "zh": "大概是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2001_007ior", "source_sha256": "c2672a56c71141ff56039aec4849a3f982a01e2fa0338b8a7d7a18e62a093bef", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと！？\nなんでアンタが近づくのよ！？", "zh": "等、等一下！？\n为什么你要靠过来啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2002_p", "source_sha256": "769326422487fcb903146e748be9bb8ad9a684bb6d9bdba25787eebf223fb469", "ja": "あ、ごめん。いや、カメラの圧力を感じてもらう\nには、近づくのがちょうどいいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。不是啦，我想说直接靠近你，\n正好可以让你体验摄影机的压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2003_007ior", "source_sha256": "6085dfa999d042f3520c8ac531bf399227ba2295c4abe087e8ba10081c74e5a3", "ja": "カメラの？　……そっか、カメラがそれくらい\n近寄ってくるってことなのね……。", "zh": "摄影机的压力？\n……这样啊，意思就是摄影机会靠得那么近吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2004_007ior", "source_sha256": "f7fb3d963621fef1951ae34e72c212221addff91f4052cc96dbf0f24247c6afb", "ja": "うん、お肌の手入れも、しっかりしておいた方が\nいいみたい。ありがと、参考になったわ。", "zh": "嗯，看来要事先仔细做好肌肤保养会比较好。\n谢谢啰，很有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2005_p", "source_sha256": "2024de089fafc64e72be6e73dfa97e9925c80fdb5f8ba03ead81fccd4fcf8485", "ja": "肌の手入れ？　俺にはツヤツヤに見えるけど……\nもしかして、じつはカサカサしてるのか？", "zh": "保养肌肤？我看起来觉得很光滑啊……\n该不会其实很干燥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2006_007ior", "source_sha256": "37455db3f814c575897a137e2eeb948b437d5f86117f513f7be62fe3c06ac3d5", "ja": "失礼ねっ、ツヤツヤのプルプルに決まってるでしょ！？\n嘘だと思うなら、たしかめてみなさいよっ。", "zh": "真没礼貌，当然是很光滑弹润的啊！？\n你要是不信，就来确认看看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_2007", "source_sha256": "f867eab78a7e8b6beb38cf3f3dcb81fe4c52a908d9658f3d5374f9f05c2f0d80", "ja": "どれどれ", "zh": "我看看", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3000_007ior", "source_sha256": "d36c911a4ec83f4d783f76e5be38fdf3421dfb45c20f61054ce3f12bff8ce0f5", "ja": "ひゃっ！　ちょ、ちょっと、\nくすぐったい触り方しないでっ！", "zh": "哇！喂，等等，\n不要这样摸，很痒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3001_p", "source_sha256": "7f6f9da02b18595054c770847a089f6c753f83f673e3b2bb1b99396161f89c15", "ja": "あ、ごめんごめん！　でも、すごいじゃないか伊織。\n本当にぷるぷるでピカピカだ……！", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉！不过，伊织太厉害了，\n真的弹润到脸上有光……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3002_007ior", "source_sha256": "46b6a7c70dc353edc8d36e4d946466f25600c915af9a101c13389013c8e66e20", "ja": "ピカピカ……？\nま、まあ、わかったならいいわ。", "zh": "脸上有光……？\n算、算了，知道厉害就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3003_p", "source_sha256": "4021405ffb603e85257f61c4dc4c53346e64980a99b4a9bff7475878557a5566", "ja": "でも、それならお手入れは必要ないんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，既然如此不就不需要保养了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3004_007ior", "source_sha256": "313ad39b3f06e6b6bb5b1fd9836cb4d7526524cc3028e356203824f8b741217f", "ja": "ダメよ。私ぐらいになると、この程度のツヤツヤの\nプルプルじゃ、満足できないの！", "zh": "不行。到了我这个水准以后，\n光是这种程度的光滑弹润，是无法满足我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3005_p", "source_sha256": "8d073b3bcdeccc55e9526605bec18b305ea2d52e41586e51732fa33097111791", "ja": "そうか……。あ、そういえばこの間のバラ園の\nローズウォーターが、評判いいって聞いたような……？", "zh": "这样啊……啊，话说之前那座玫瑰园的玫瑰水，\n听说评价很好喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3006_007ior", "source_sha256": "581e11313185d575d8755ca1afb2838802687546977e83d3f27fad4014f19529", "ja": "それよっ♪　今から行って買い占めなきゃ！\nそれじゃ、手配をお願いね♪", "zh": "就是那个♪得马上过去全部买下来才行！\n那就麻烦你去做准备啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3007_p", "source_sha256": "ceff58fa98b61e29c1dc44912ddee15525b62625bf8098fb5fae19e58ccbd541", "ja": "えっ……。それはもしかして、\n俺に買い占めろっていう……？", "zh": "什么……你的意思，\n该不会是要叫我买单全包吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3008_007ior", "source_sha256": "f1c9378a36f3cb5d08e49cec391c551894255d6420395390dee518152ca2ea2e", "ja": "違うわよ、車の手配！　誰もアンタの安月給なんかに\n期待してないんだから。", "zh": "不是啦，我是叫你去准备车子！\n没有人在期待你的低月薪啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0064_3009_007ior", "source_sha256": "4a87c894a68fe6127abc258826adeb23ba80de56613f8e1e3e17ba47be554b60", "ja": "ほら、ホッとした顔してないで、\nさっさと行きなさいよね。急ぎなさ～い！", "zh": "好了，别摆出松一口气的表情了，\n赶快去啦。动作快～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
